WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.720
Dear Fellow Scholars, this is Two Minute Papers
with Dr. Károly Zsolnai-Fehér.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:10.480
Today we are going to have a look at this
magical AI from scientists at the Weizmann

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:17.080
Institute of Science and NVIDIA which promises
magical video editing powers.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:22.140
So let’s see 4 of my favorite things it
can do together.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:30.369
One, we can take this unremarkable video of
a car passing by, and my goodness, look at

00:00:30.369 --> 00:00:31.369
that.

00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:37.140
It has completely revamped the scene: first,
it made sure that it is nighttime, and has

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:41.190
given the car a nice neon cyberpunk look.

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:45.140
So, this took quite a bit of work for someone,
right?

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:46.969
Well, not quite!

00:00:46.969 --> 00:00:53.870
To achieve this, all we need to do is give
the AI a video and two text prompts.

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:57.399
One for the foreground, and one for the background.

00:00:57.399 --> 00:01:03.010
And if we are looking for an example that
is a little less out there, we can also ask

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:06.760
that the car is made rusty instead.

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:07.810
So cool!

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:13.570
Two, once again, if we did not show up in
the right outfit for a day, or would like

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:19.620
to see what we would look like wearing something
else before buying it, look no more.

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:23.560
Yes, this is also just one text prompt away.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:31.430
I particularly like this example because this
outfit has lots of wrinkles and geometry changes,

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:34.810
and the new technique can follow them really
well.

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:40.750
Now, if you look close, you see that there
is also a price to be paid for this.

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:46.390
Look, the new synthesized results are not
as detailed as the original video.

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:52.729
Now, we said that it can do foreground and
background editing separately.

00:01:52.729 --> 00:01:54.590
And that was the foreground.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:56.860
But what about the background?

00:01:56.860 --> 00:02:01.890
Oh yes, let’s make this environment a little
foggier.

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:02.980
Look at that!

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:05.180
I love this one.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.190
Even the shadows have become foggier.

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:09.190
So cool!

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:15.340
And, the shadows are even taken away for the
nighttime shot because of the different lighting

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:16.340
setup.

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:21.190
I would like these results a great deal for
images, but for video?

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:23.940
Such an amazing result for video.

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:24.940
Wow.

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:31.500
Now, of course, this kind of layered editing
concept can be applied to images too, and

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.790
the results are outstanding.

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:39.790
For instance, three if we have this boring
cake, we can reimagine it if it were made

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:46.959
of oreo instead, or if we wish to let our
imagination run wild, or we are light transport

00:02:46.959 --> 00:02:52.140
researchers, we can ask the AI to make it
out of ice.

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.140
Loving it.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:58.800
Now, if you aren’t hungry enough yet, here
is a piece of bread that can be converted

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:04.750
to the legendary red velvet bread too, or,
once again, ice.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:11.239
Four, the authors call these semi-transparent
effects where we can choose a small part of

00:03:11.239 --> 00:03:17.690
an already existing image, add a text prompt,
for instance, fire, and then, bam!

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:23.160
We suddenly have a fire-breathing bear, or
a beautiful cup of coffee.

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:26.590
This technique can truly do so much.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:32.189
Now I would like to send huge thank you to
the authors of the paper because the source

00:03:32.189 --> 00:03:35.270
code for this project is also available.

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:41.980
So, AI-driven layered image editing is possible
for free, and for everyone!

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:47.720
And just imagine what this technique will
be able to do just a couple more papers down

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:48.900
the line.

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.180
What a time to be alive!

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:52.489
So, what do you think?

00:03:52.489 --> 00:03:54.420
What would you use this for?

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:59.010
Let me know in the comments below!

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:40.949
Thanks for watching and 
for your generous support, and I'll see 

00:04:40.949 --> 00:04:44.380
you next time!

